================================================================
Datasets and corpora
================================================================

llcore ships **no** dataset or corpus in this repository or in the PyPI
distribution. The optional RAD-corpus hint feature (`src/llcore/rad/`)
reads a locally provisioned corpus directory referenced by the
`LLCORE_RAD_DIR` environment variable; when the variable is unset or the
directory is absent, the feature degrades gracefully (no hints). Each
corpus directory contains content licensed under its own terms — **users
are responsible for verifying the license of each individual corpus**
before redistribution.

